(B) Theorem 2(iii): where the memoriser-regime conclusion applies (d=100, m=20, p=2^-10, B=inf, kappa=0, delta_S=0)
  c = 0.100 * 2^-m: condition rho < (1-c2^m)B_S/2^m holds: True; error-label prob e >= 0.995
  c = 0.500 * 2^-m: condition rho < (1-c2^m)B_S/2^m holds: True; error-label prob e >= 0.955
  c = 0.900 * 2^-m: condition rho < (1-c2^m)B_S/2^m holds: True; error-label prob e >= 0.658
  c = 0.950 * 2^-m: condition rho < (1-c2^m)B_S/2^m holds: True; error-label prob e >= 0.414
  c = 0.990 * 2^-m: condition rho < (1-c2^m)B_S/2^m holds: True; error-label prob e >= 0.010
  c = 0.995 * 2^-m: condition rho < (1-c2^m)B_S/2^m holds: False; error-label prob e >= nan
